Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}25{\fs68}日傍晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:19.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿拉木图站男单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}去年在这里夺冠的梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:24.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}先丢一盘 再逆转巴西拉什维利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:28.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}职业生涯第一次 他成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}作为头号种子 他首轮轮空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:35.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二轮和{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛连赢{\fs78}4{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:39.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛布勃利克只打了一盘就退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:42.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}打进决赛之前 他一盘没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Pretty much the ideal first-up match you want to have in a tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几乎是一项赛事里最理想的首战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that'll do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Comfortable in the end for our top seed and defending champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子兼卫冕冠军 赢得轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another semi-final this season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本赛季又一个半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:18.40,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that'll do for set number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘就到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:23.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And we'll hold for a moment. Medvedev goes six games to three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N先停一下 梅德韦杰夫{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:26.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He sits, he stands, he walks over.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他坐下 又站起来 走了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:28.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Bublik comes across and says that'll do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布勃利克过来说 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.64,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛对手巴西拉什维利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从资格赛一路打上来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛淘汰了西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:38.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 梅德韦杰夫发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:41.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68} 对手拿到两个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:44.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一个盘点 对手选择和他反手对拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}那正是梅德韦杰夫最拿手的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:17.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a dangerous game to play when you start trading backhand to backhand with Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N跟梅德韦杰夫反手对拉很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is his absolute bread and butter.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那正是他的看家本领
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.35,0:02:20.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两个盘点都救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}抢七却以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}丢掉首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:26.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘他两次破发 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:28.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘第三局再破发
