Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:45.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And for the first time in his career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N职业生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:47.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Daniil Medvedev successfully defends a title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梅德韦杰夫成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:51.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-seven, six-one, six-three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Champion last year in Almaty, champion this year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年在这里夺冠 今年还是冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:59.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His fourth title of 2026, his 25th overall.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年第{\fs78}4{\fs68}冠 生涯第{\fs78}25{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:04.40,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A big battle, but he's had a superb week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场硬仗 但他这一周太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:13.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Daniil Medvedev, our top seed, our defending champion, is successful.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子 卫冕冠军梅德韦杰夫赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:15.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He wins at 6-3 in the third.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.35,0:03:16.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛{\fs78}22{\fs68}记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}
